      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "graph-native-membrane-smoke"
        },
        "markdown": "## Shape the membrane\n\nThe Declaration is membrane #1. The four attached `membrane` nodes are boundary controls. In edit mode, drag any control node: its center is a point on the outline, so the shape changes immediately. The second control has an optional `angle` that steers the curve tangent; it does not place the point."
      },
